# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HOW TO USE: copy this file, name the copy  .env  (same folder as main.py),
# fill in the values, then restart the backend. It is loaded automatically.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: a long random secret for login tokens (the app makes one itself if empty).
# ARANYA_SECRET_KEY=replace-with-a-long-random-secret

# ----- EMAIL for "Forgot password" codes -----
# Without these 4 lines NO email is sent (the code only appears in the backend console).
#
# Gmail setup (5 minutes):
#   1. Use a Gmail account for sending (e.g. aranyaai.noreply@gmail.com).
#   2. Google Account -> Security -> turn ON "2-Step Verification".
#   3. Google Account -> Security -> "App passwords" -> create one (name: AranyaAI).
#      Google shows a 16-letter password. Paste it below WITHOUT spaces.
#   4. Remove the leading # from the 5 lines below and fill them in.
#   5. Restart the backend, then run:  python test_email.py your-own-email@gmail.com
#
ARANYA_SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
ARANYA_SMTP_PORT=587
ARANYA_SMTP_USER=sha01133646@gmail.com
ARANYA_SMTP_PASSWORD=hfaxqfrfjjoaqtoa
ARANYA_SMTP_FROM=sha01133646@gmail.com
